# Kallias, the potter at the agora workshop. Three questions that lead into
# three different conversations, each with its own ending.
# Text is a key: the panel translates it, so EN/RU stay in strings.csv.
# Indent with tabs: DM's INDENT_REGEX is ^\t+.

~ start
Kallias: NPC_POTTER_1
- LOC_POTTER_CHOICE_1
	Kallias: LOC_POTTER_CUPS_1
	Kallias: LOC_POTTER_CUPS_2
	Kallias: LOC_POTTER_CUPS_3
- LOC_POTTER_CHOICE_2
	Kallias: NPC_POTTER_2
	Kallias: LOC_POTTER_BREAK_1
	Kallias: NPC_POTTER_4
- LOC_POTTER_CHOICE_3
	Kallias: NPC_POTTER_3
	Kallias: LOC_POTTER_GODS_1
=> END
